# Copy this to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in real values.
# Source it before running tools that need these vars:
#
#   set -a; source .env; set +a   # POSIX-ish; works in zsh/bash
#
# or use a tool like direnv to auto-source on cd into this repo.

# ---- agents-team paths -----------------------------------------------------
# Override the default project-root vault location if you want notes to land
# in your real Obsidian vault elsewhere on disk.
# AGENTS_TEAM_VAULT_PATH=/Users/you/Obsidian/your-vault

# Relocate the renders/ directory (interactive HTML produced by the `render`
# skill). Defaults to <repo>/renders.
# AGENTS_TEAM_RENDERS_PATH=/Users/you/agents-team-renders

# Relocate the exports/ directory (Kami-styled PDFs produced by the `export`
# skill). Defaults to <repo>/exports.
# AGENTS_TEAM_EXPORTS_PATH=/Users/you/agents-team-exports

# Override the Chrome binary used for PDF export. Auto-detected on macOS,
# Linux, and Windows. Set this if Chrome / Chromium lives somewhere else.
# AGENTS_TEAM_CHROME_PATH=/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome
